  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgroPREI: Economic Formalization Pathways for Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgriPREI will contribute to the 2020 Transition Strategy from the Informal Economy to the Formal Economy of Angola by directly and indirectly investing in youth and women agroeconomic formalization initiatives increasing their productivity, income, competitiveness and to create evidence for formalization transition pathway of smallholders farmers and agribusiness sector.</narrative>
  </description>
